  {#if session.sheet==='open'}<p>Choose an actual shared file or enter its canonical identity.</p><label>File ID<input bind:value={fileId} data-preview-control="fileId"/></label><button onclick={()=>command('open',{fileId})}>Open File</button><button onclick={()=>command('open.picker')}>Choose File…</button>
  {:else if session.sheet==='export'}<label>Export As<input bind:value={exportName}/></label><label>Format<select bind:value={exportFormat}>{#if pdf}<option value="pdf">PDF</option>{:else}<option value="png">PNG</option><option value="jpeg">JPEG</option><option value="webp">WebP</option>{/if}</select></label>{#if pdf}<label class="preview-check"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={flatten}/>Flatten supported form fields</label><p>Genuine PDF output. Fictional passwords do not encrypt exported bytes. Existing encrypted PDFs cannot be edited here.</p>{/if}<button class="primary" onclick={()=>command('export',{name:exportName,format:exportFormat,flatten})}>Export to Files</button>
  {:else if session.sheet==='inspector'&&selected}<dl><dt>File</dt><dd>{selected.name}</dd><dt>Actual Files ID</dt><dd>{selected.fileId??'Unsaved'}</dd><dt>Source revision</dt><dd>{selected.fileRevision}</dd><dt>Buffer revision</dt><dd>{selected.revision}</dd><dt>Format</dt><dd>{selected.mime}</dd><dt>Pages</dt><dd>{count}</dd>{#each selected.metadata as row}<dt>{row.name}</dt><dd>{row.value}</dd>{/each}</dl><p>{pdf?'Page geometry is in PDF points (72/in); rendered canvas uses CSS points and bounded display DPI.':'Image dimensions are source pixels.'}</p>
  {:else if session.sheet==='pages'}{#if cap.windows}<p>Page editing is a functional local extension, not an Edge 118 native feature.</p>{/if}<div class="preview-form-row"><label>Move page<input type="number" min="1" max={count} bind:value={fromPage}/></label><label>To position<input type="number" min="1" max={count} bind:value={toPage}/></label><button onclick={()=>command('page.move',{from:fromPage,to:toPage})}>Move</button></div><button disabled={count<2} onclick={()=>command('page.delete',{page:session.page})}>Delete Current Page</button><label>Insert / merge PDF File ID<input bind:value={fileId}/></label><div class="preview-form-row"><label>After page (0 = before first)<input type="number" min="0" max={count} bind:value={insertAfter}/></label><label>Source page (0 = all)<input type="number" min="0" max="256" bind:value={insertPage}/></label></div><button onclick={()=>command('page.insert',{fileId,after:insertAfter,...(insertPage?{page:insertPage}:{})})}>Insert Actual PDF Pages</button><p>Local PDF only, up to 256 resulting pages. Unsupported encrypted imports reject; no source file is mutated. {classic?'The initial insertion position follows the classic guide: before the current page.':'The initial insertion position follows the modern guide: after the current page.'}</p>
  {:else if session.sheet==='signature'}<p>Fictional signature appearance only — no camera, trackpad capture, certificate or legal identity verification.{cap.windows?' Local extension; not an Edge 118 signature feature.':''}</p><div class="preview-segments"><button class:pressed={signatureMode==='typed'} onclick={()=>signatureMode='typed'}>Type</button><button class:pressed={signatureMode==='drawn'} onclick={()=>signatureMode='drawn'}>Draw</button></div>{#if signatureMode==='typed'}<label>Fictional Name<input bind:value={signatureName} maxlength="256"/></label><div class="preview-signature-sample">{signatureName}</div>{:else}<canvas bind:this={signatureCanvas} width="340" height="110" class="preview-signature-pad" onpointerdown={event=>signaturePointer(event,'start')} onpointermove={event=>signaturePointer(event,'move')} onpointerup={event=>signaturePointer(event,'end')} onpointercancel={()=>signatureStroke=false} aria-label="Draw fictional signature"></canvas><button onclick={clearSignature}>Clear</button>{/if}<button class="primary" onclick={insertSignature}>Add Signature to Actual PDF</button>
  {:else if session.sheet==='forms'&&selected}{#if !previewForms(selected).length}<p>This PDF has no supported AcroForm fields on retained pages.</p>{/if}{#each previewForms(selected) as field}{@const value=selected.edits.formValues.find(f=>f.name===field.name)?.value??field.value}<label>{field.name}{field.readOnly?' (read only)':''}{#if field.type==='checkbox'}<input type="checkbox" disabled={field.readOnly} checked={!!value} onchange={event=>command('form',{name:field.name,value:event.currentTarget.checked})}/>{:else if ['dropdown','option','radio'].includes(field.type)}<select disabled={field.readOnly} value={String(value)} onchange={event=>command('form',{name:field.name,value:event.currentTarget.value})}>{#each field.options as option}<option value={option}>{option}</option>{/each}</select>{:else if field.type==='text'}<input disabled={field.readOnly} value={String(value)} maxlength="16384" onchange={event=>command('form',{name:field.name,value:event.currentTarget.value})}/>{:else}<span>{field.type} field — cannot be cryptographically signed here</span>{/if}</label>{/each}<p>Actual AcroForm values are saved in genuine PDFs. XFA and digital signing are unavailable.</p>
  {:else if session.sheet==='lock'||session.sheet==='unlock'}<p><strong>Fictional access gate only.</strong> No PDF encryption, owner permissions or cryptography is applied. Exported PDFs remain readable. Password-protected source editing is unavailable.</p><label>{selected?.edits.lock.enabled?'Current fictional password':'New fictional password'}<input type="password" bind:value={secret} maxlength="256"/></label>{#if session.sheet==='unlock'}<button class="primary" onclick={()=>command('unlock',{password:secret})}>Unlock</button>{:else}<button class="primary" onclick={()=>command('lock',{enabled:!selected?.edits.lock.enabled,password:secret})}>{selected?.edits.lock.enabled?'Remove Fictional Gate':'Lock Fictionally'}</button>{/if}
  {:else if session.sheet==='image'}<p>Edits transform actual PNG/JPEG/WebP pixels. Dimensions and crop coordinates are source pixels; bounded to 4 megapixels and 8192 pixels per edge.</p><label class="preview-check"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={cropEnabled}/>Crop before resizing</label>{#if cropEnabled}<div class="preview-form-row">{#each ['x','y','width','height'] as label}<label>{label}{#if label==='x'}<input type="number" min="0" bind:value={cropX}/>{:else if label==='y'}<input type="number" min="0" bind:value={cropY}/>{:else if label==='width'}<input type="number" min="1" bind:value={cropWidth}/>{:else}<input type="number" min="1" bind:value={cropHeight}/>{/if}</label>{/each}</div>{/if}<div class="preview-form-row"><label>Width<input type="number" min="1" max="8192" bind:value={imageWidth}/></label><label>Height<input type="number" min="1" max="8192" bind:value={imageHeight}/></label></div><label>Brightness {brightness}<input type="range" min="-100" max="100" bind:value={brightness}/></label><label>Contrast {contrast}<input type="range" min="-100" max="100" bind:value={contrast}/></label><label>Saturation {saturation}<input type="range" min="-100" max="100" bind:value={saturation}/></label><button class="primary" onclick={()=>command('image',{...(cropEnabled?{crop:{x:cropX,y:cropY,width:cropWidth,height:cropHeight}}:{}),width:imageWidth,height:imageHeight,brightness,contrast,saturation})}>Apply Pixel Edits</button>
  {:else if session.sheet==='close'}<p>Do you want to save changes to “{selected?.name}”? Closing keeps the canonical document buffer; Discard closes this window without writing Files.</p><div class="preview-form-row"><button onclick={()=>command('window.close',{decision:'discard'})}>Discard</button><button onclick={()=>command('window.close',{decision:'cancel'})}>Cancel</button><button class="primary" onclick={()=>command('window.close',{decision:'save'})}>Save</button></div>
  {:else if session.sheet==='help'}<p>{cap.availability}</p><p>Locally authored itinerary, real PDF.js render and selection, pdf-lib serialization. PDF edits include vector markup, page reorder/merge/delete, supported AcroForms and fictional signature appearances. Images support PNG, JPEG and WebP crop, resize, rotate and color adjustment.</p><p>No host filesystem, network documents, camera, digital signing or cryptographic PDF encryption. Fictional local gating remains clearly labeled. Markup uses bundled open-licensed Liberation Sans; no proprietary Apple/Microsoft fonts or screenshots redistributed. Native era fidelity is documented with primary sources; actual integrated runtime verification belongs to the parent.</p><p>Keyboard: {cap.windows?'Ctrl':'⌘'} O / S / P / F / W / Z. Select native PDF text to copy or highlight. Draw shapes and ink directly on the real rendered page.</p>{/if}
  {#if message}<p class="preview-error" role="alert">{message}</p>{/if}{#if session.sheet!=='close'}<div class="preview-sheet-actions"><button onclick={()=>command('sheet.close')}>Done</button></div>{/if}
 </section></div>{/if}
</section>
